WEBVTT

00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:14.099
<v Host>Welcome to Japanese Daily News. I'm Maya. Today is October eighteenth. One of Japan's most famous castle towers is getting a special national title. Let's listen.

00:00:14.699 --> 00:00:17.579
<v News>今日のニュースです。

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:26.056
<v News>大阪城の天守閣が、国の重要文化財になることになりました。

00:00:26.756 --> 00:00:35.276
<v News>10月16日、国の文化審議会が決めて、大臣に伝えました。

00:00:35.975 --> 00:00:43.176
<v News>今の天守閣は、1931年に建てられました。

00:00:43.875 --> 00:00:49.515
<v News>大阪の人たちが、お金を出し合って建てました。

00:00:50.216 --> 00:00:56.119
<v News>鉄とコンクリートを使った、新しい建物でした。

00:00:56.820 --> 00:01:08.819
<v News>昔の天守閣は、豊臣秀吉の時代に建てられましたが、1615年の戦いで焼けてしまいました。

00:01:09.519 --> 00:01:16.695
<v News>今の天守閣は、昔の形をよく調べて作られました。

00:01:17.396 --> 00:01:25.915
<v News>中は博物館になっていて、8階から大阪の町を見ることができます。

00:01:26.615 --> 00:01:37.103
<v News>最近の1年間で、およそ280万人が訪れて、今までで一番多くなりました。

00:01:37.804 --> 00:01:46.251
<v News>奈良ホテルなど、ほかの7つの建物も、重要文化財になる予定です。

00:01:46.951 --> 00:01:48.968
<v Host>Now let's break it down.

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:57.896
<v Slow>大阪城の天守閣が、国の重要文化財になることになりました。

00:01:58.695 --> 00:02:04.359
<v Host>The main tower of Osaka Castle is going to become a national Important Cultural Property.

00:02:04.959 --> 00:02:07.432
<v Vocab>天守閣

00:02:07.831 --> 00:02:11.407
<v Host>It means the main tower, or keep, of a castle.

00:02:12.008 --> 00:02:15.127
<v Vocab>重要文化財

00:02:15.527 --> 00:02:22.560
<v Host>It means Important Cultural Property, a special title the government gives to valuable buildings and objects.

00:02:23.159 --> 00:02:32.304
<v Slow>10月16日、国の文化審議会が決めて、大臣に伝えました。

00:02:33.104 --> 00:02:39.584
<v Host>On October sixteenth, a national council on culture decided this and told the minister.

00:02:40.183 --> 00:02:42.247
<v Vocab>決める

00:02:42.647 --> 00:02:44.520
<v Host>It means to decide.

00:02:45.120 --> 00:02:47.400
<v Vocab>伝える

00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:51.015
<v Host>It means to tell, or to pass on a message.

00:02:51.616 --> 00:02:59.319
<v Slow>今の天守閣は、1931年に建てられました。

00:03:00.120 --> 00:03:03.383
<v Host>The present tower was built in nineteen thirty-one.

00:03:03.984 --> 00:03:06.120
<v Vocab>建てる

00:03:06.520 --> 00:03:08.391
<v Host>It means to build.

00:03:08.991 --> 00:03:15.015
<v Slow>大阪の人たちが、お金を出し合って建てました。

00:03:15.816 --> 00:03:19.223
<v Host>The people of Osaka put their money together to build it.

00:03:19.824 --> 00:03:22.127
<v Vocab>出し合う

00:03:22.527 --> 00:03:26.175
<v Host>It means to put in together, so everyone gives a little.

00:03:26.776 --> 00:03:33.111
<v Slow>鉄とコンクリートを使った、新しい建物でした。

00:03:33.912 --> 00:03:38.304
<v Host>It was a new kind of building, made with steel and concrete.

00:03:38.903 --> 00:03:40.872
<v Vocab>鉄

00:03:41.271 --> 00:03:43.527
<v Host>It means iron or steel.

00:03:44.127 --> 00:03:46.407
<v Vocab>建物

00:03:46.807 --> 00:03:48.680
<v Host>It means a building.

00:03:49.280 --> 00:04:02.144
<v Slow>昔の天守閣は、豊臣秀吉の時代に建てられましたが、1615年の戦いで焼けてしまいました。

00:04:02.943 --> 00:04:09.879
<v Host>The old tower was built in the time of a famous ruler, but it burned down in a battle in sixteen fifteen.

00:04:10.479 --> 00:04:12.783
<v Vocab>昔

00:04:13.183 --> 00:04:15.991
<v Host>It means long ago, or the old days.

00:04:16.591 --> 00:04:18.680
<v Vocab>時代

00:04:19.079 --> 00:04:22.151
<v Host>It means an era or a period of history.

00:04:22.752 --> 00:04:24.863
<v Vocab>焼ける

00:04:25.264 --> 00:04:27.136
<v Host>It means to burn.

00:04:27.735 --> 00:04:35.415
<v Slow>今の天守閣は、昔の形をよく調べて作られました。

00:04:36.216 --> 00:04:40.536
<v Host>The present tower was made after carefully studying the old shape.

00:04:41.136 --> 00:04:43.007
<v Vocab>形

00:04:43.408 --> 00:04:45.471
<v Host>It means shape or form.

00:04:46.072 --> 00:04:48.375
<v Vocab>調べる

00:04:48.776 --> 00:04:51.199
<v Host>It means to check or to research.

00:04:51.800 --> 00:05:00.944
<v Slow>中は博物館になっていて、8階から大阪の町を見ることができます。

00:05:01.744 --> 00:05:06.927
<v Host>Inside is a museum, and from the eighth floor you can see the city of Osaka.

00:05:07.528 --> 00:05:10.120
<v Vocab>博物館

00:05:10.519 --> 00:05:12.391
<v Host>It means a museum.

00:05:12.992 --> 00:05:14.935
<v Vocab>町

00:05:15.336 --> 00:05:17.543
<v Host>It means a town or a city.

00:05:18.144 --> 00:05:29.375
<v Slow>最近の1年間で、およそ280万人が訪れて、今までで一番多くなりました。

00:05:30.175 --> 00:05:36.055
<v Host>In the most recent year, about two point eight million people visited, the most ever.

00:05:36.656 --> 00:05:39.079
<v Vocab>訪れる

00:05:39.480 --> 00:05:41.351
<v Host>It means to visit.

00:05:41.951 --> 00:05:44.160
<v Vocab>一番

00:05:44.560 --> 00:05:47.151
<v Host>It means number one, or the most.

00:05:47.752 --> 00:05:56.824
<v Slow>奈良ホテルなど、ほかの7つの建物も、重要文化財になる予定です。

00:05:57.624 --> 00:06:04.271
<v Host>Seven other buildings, such as the Nara Hotel, are also set to become Important Cultural Properties.

00:06:04.872 --> 00:06:06.983
<v Vocab>予定

00:06:07.384 --> 00:06:10.408
<v Host>It means a plan, or something that is scheduled.

00:06:11.007 --> 00:06:13.767
<v Host>Now listen to the full story again.

00:06:14.367 --> 00:06:17.247
<v News>今日のニュースです。

